= Instructions

Muddle very ripe fresh @Strawberries{5-6} (can substitute raspberries) and @Simple syrup{1/2 oz} in a #Cocktail shaker{} until well mashed.

Add @White rum{2 oz}, fresh @Lime juice{1 oz}, and @Ice{6-8 cubes} cubes. Shake until well chilled.

Pour through a #Sieve{} (don’t use the shaker strainer*) into chilled #Martini or coup glass{}. Garnish with a strawberry.

> *The shaker strainer clogs too quickly with strawberry pulp. A sieve works better.